      "content": "hey, quick question. i started taking sertraline (zoloft) a few weeks ago for my anxiety and its helping a lot, but i have this really bad dry cough from a cold and i can't stop coughing. is it okay if i take some of that generic DayQuil or nyquil stuff to help with the cough? i just wanna get some sleep.",
